## Penguin-flavoured markdown

- `*` is strong and `_` is emphasis, they never swap
- superscript: E = mc^2^
- subscript: H~2~O
- strikethrough: ~~old~~ new

| syntax | output |
| ------ | ------ |
| `^x^`  | ^x^    |
| `~x~`  | ~x~    |

```js
console.log('fenced code only, indentation means nothing');
```

> blockquotes need a `>`
> on every line
